OL,3,GNEWSALiverpool legend's shirt fetches
OL,4,A#56,000 at auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FShirts, medals and other memorabilia
OL,7,Fbelonging to former Liverpool captain
OL,8,FEmlyn Hughes have gone under the hammer
OL,9,Fat auction today.
OL,11,FAmong the 247 items sold by his family
OL,12,Fwas the shirt he wore the first time
OL,13,Fthe Reds won the European Cup in 1977
OL,14,Fwhich fetched #56,000.
OL,16,FThe collection was put together by his
OL,17,Fson and daughter, Emlyn Junior and Emma
OL,18,Fwho said he "would have loved to see
OL,19,Fpeople bidding from all over the
OL,20,Fworld".
