OL,3,GNEWSALiverpool legend's shirt fetches
OL,4,A#56,000 at auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FHughes, who died in 2004 aged 57, was
OL,7,Fone of Liverpool's greatest players,
OL,8,Fappearing 665 times and winning four
OL,9,Fleague titles, the FA Cup and both
OL,10,FEuropean trophies twice during his time
OL,11,Fat the Reds.
